          text: '“Perhaps not immediately,” Sheikh Uncle replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 434867),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 442095),
          text:
              '“But there is an important difference between causing wrongdoing and allowing wrongdoing to become known.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
