          end: Duration(milliseconds: 444135),
          text: 'Imaan became thoughtful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 444135),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 448695),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle continued, “However, there is another danger.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 448695),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 449695),
          text: '“What?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 449695),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 457215),
          text:
              '“Thinking that because we told the truth, we are automatically better than the people who made the mistake.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 457928),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 459495),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
