          text: '“Idris, peace be upon him.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 493709),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494891),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 494891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 496891),
          text: '“What do you know about him?”',
