          end: Duration(milliseconds: 502999),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle smiled slightly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 502999),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 506419),
          text: '“That is something often mentioned in traditional accounts.',
