          start: Duration(milliseconds: 69388),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 71908),
          text: 'Imaan laughed, but Akhlaq did not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 71908),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76908),
          text:
              'For him, yesterday’s lesson about truthfulness had seemed clear.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76908),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79586),
          text: 'They had seen something wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79586),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82908),
          text: 'They had reported only what they knew.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 83409),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85755),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle had investigated it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85755),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87976),
          text: 'The truth had come out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87976),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89795),
          text: 'That part was finished.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89795),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 92715),
          text: 'Or at least Akhlaq thought it was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 92716),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101275),
          text:
              'What he had not expected was that telling the truth could create a problem that lasted longer than the moment of truth itself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101275),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105031),
          text: 'During lunch break, the football teams were being selected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105031),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108120),
          text: 'Hamza was one of the captains.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108120),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109664),
          text: 'He chose Bilal.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110694),
          text: 'Then Umar.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110694),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111723),
          text: 'Then Saad.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112265),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112807),
          text: 'Akhlaq waited.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112807),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 117141),
          text: 'Almost everyone knew Akhlaq was one of the better players.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 117141),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119797),
          text: 'Hamza chose two younger students.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 120381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121842),
          text: 'Akhlaq raised an eyebrow.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121842),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124606),
          text: 'Finally, only Akhlaq remained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 124606),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 126201),
          text: 'Hamza looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126201),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128394),
          text: '“You can join the other team.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128992),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 130514),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s face became hot.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 132811),
          text: '“That team is already full.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132811),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 134234),
          text: 'Hamza shrugged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134234),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135219),
          text: '“Then watch.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138413),
          text: 'A few children became uncomfortable.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138413),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141781),
          text: 'One boy whispered, “Hamza, just let him play.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141781),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142771),
          text: '“I said watch.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 143438),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146179),
          text: 'Akhlaq wanted to answer immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146179),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150740),
          text: 'He wanted to remind Hamza who had actually cheated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150740),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 155819),
          text: 'He wanted to say, You are angry because you got caught.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 155819),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158699),
          text: 'The words reached his tongue.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 158699),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 161819),
          text: 'Then he remembered Sheikh Uncle’s warning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 161819),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165145),
          text: 'Truth was not something to use like a weapon.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 167158),
          text: 'Akhlaq closed his mouth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 167158),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170661),
          text: 'He turned and walked towards the old tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171182),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 172617),
          text: 'Imaan followed him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172617),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174313),
          text: '“That was unfair.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174313),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174965),
          text: '“I know.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 177834),
          text: '“You could tell Sheikh Uncle.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178747),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180211),
          text: 'Akhlaq sat on the low wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180211),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185872),
          text:
              '“I’m not telling Sheikh Uncle every time Hamza looks at me badly.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 186323),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187675),
          text: 'Imaan sat beside him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190875),
          text: 'For several seconds, neither spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190875),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193476),
          text: 'Then Akhlaq kicked a dry leaf.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 193476),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195396),
          text: '“I did the right thing yesterday.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195396),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196795),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196795),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200075),
          text: '“And today I’m the one sitting outside the game.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200075),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 201595),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202676),
          text: '“That does not seem fair.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204684),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206323),
          text: 'He looked at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206323),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 208524),
          text: '“That is all you are going to say?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209070),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210163),
          text: 'Imaan shrugged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210163),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214363),
          text:
              '“I don’t think saying ‘be patient’ right now would improve your mood.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214363),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215804),
          text: '“It would not.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215804),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218083),
          text: 'So she stayed quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218083),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219097),
          text: 'That surprised Akhlaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219643),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224431),
          text: 'And somehow, the silence helped more than advice.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224431),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231752),
          text:
              'Later that afternoon, Ms. Sana announced that every group would prepare a small display for the school’s learning fair.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231752),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236312),
          text: '“Your display will stay up for one week,” she explained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236312),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239951),
          text: '“Each group must improve it every day.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240415),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242271),
          text: 'Akhlaq immediately raised his hand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242620),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244620),
          text: '“Why can’t we finish it today?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244620),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246259),
          text: 'Half the class laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246694),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247779),
          text: 'Ms. Sana smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247779),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 250919),
          text: '“Because improvement is part of the assignment.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251497),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252459),
          text: 'Akhlaq leaned back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253765),
          text: '“Of course it is.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 254200),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255985),
          text: 'Imaan whispered, “Patience.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 258099),
          text: 'He gave her a warning look.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261780),
          text: 'Their group received the topic Water Conservation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262393),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264027),
          text: 'Akhlaq began working quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264027),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270708),
          text:
              'He drew a large tap on the chart, wrote three points underneath and proudly placed the marker down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271547),
          text: '“Finished.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271900),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 273307),
          text: 'Imaan looked at the chart.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 273307),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276187),
          text: '“You wrote ‘Save Water’ three times.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276188),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279107),
          text: '“They are three very important words.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279108),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281267),
          text: '“You wrote the same three words.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 281267),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282588),
          text: '“Consistency.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283004),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283631),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283989),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285244),
          text: 'Ms. Sana walked over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285244),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287035),
          text: 'She examined their work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287035),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288263),
          text: '“Good beginning.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 289585),
          text: 'Akhlaq frowned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 289585),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290435),
          text: '“Beginning?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290436),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290736),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290736),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292135),
          text: '“But I finished it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292535),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 296535),
          text: 'Ms. Sana pointed towards the empty half of the chart.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 296535),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304524),
          text:
              '“You have space for examples, drawings, perhaps a small model, some facts…”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 306324),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307524),
          text: 'Akhlaq sighed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 307524),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 310224),
          text: '“Everything takes time.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 310795),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312224),
          text: 'Ms. Sana smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312224),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315024),
          text: '“Most things worth improving do.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315024),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319724),
          text: 'The words irritated him more than they normally would have.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319724),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 322008),
          text: 'By the end of the lesson, Akhlaq had lost interest.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 322492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 326491),
          text: '“I don’t want to keep working on this for a week.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 326879),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 329492),
          text: 'Imaan continued colouring a water tank.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 329492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 332492),
          text: '“You don’t have to enjoy every minute.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 332492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 334492),
          text: '“That sounds terrible.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 334492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 336492),
          text: '“It is also true.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 337169),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 339492),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked towards Hamza’s group.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 339492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 342459),
          text: 'Hamza was laughing with his friends.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 342459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344459),
          text: 'His anger returned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 344459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 349460),
          text:
              '“What is the point of being patient with people who are not patient with you?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 349873),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 350597),
          text: 'Imaan stopped colouring.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 351425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353701),
          text: 'She did not know the answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353701),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 355459),
          text: 'But Sheikh Uncle did.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 355459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 359459),
          text: 'That evening, they found him in the Academy library.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 362459),
          text: 'He was arranging Qur’an copies on a shelf.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 362966),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 364428),
          text: 'Akhlaq stood near the doorway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 365428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 366428),
          text: '“Sheikh Uncle?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 366428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 367428),
          text: '“Yes?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 367428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 368856),
          text: '“I have a complaint about patience.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370053),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 371428),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle turned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 371428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 373428),
          text: '“That sounds serious.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 373428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 374428),
          text: '“It is.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 374894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 377428),
          text: 'Akhlaq explained what had happened during football.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 381427),
          text: 'He expected Sheikh Uncle to immediately call Hamza.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 381428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 385516),
          text: 'Instead, Sheikh Uncle asked, “Did he insult you?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 385516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 386516),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 386516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 387516),
          text: '“Threaten you?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 387516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 388516),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 388516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 391675),
          text: '“Prevent you from attending class or cause you harm?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 391676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 394875),
          text: '“No. He just deliberately left me out.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 395426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 396636),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 396636),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 398996),
          text: '“That was not a good way for him to behave.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 399663),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 400236),
          text: 'Akhlaq waited.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 400236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 401236),
          text: '“So?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 401236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 402236),
          text: '“So what?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 402236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 403964),
          text: '“What are you going to do?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 404272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 405444),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle smiled slightly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 405444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 407044),
          text: '“Nothing tonight.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 407712),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 408763),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 408764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 409764),
          text: '“Nothing?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 409764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 410764),
          text: '“Nothing.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 410764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 413403),
          text: '“But he is angry because I told the truth.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 413403),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 414403),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 414403),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417524),
          text: '“So shouldn’t somebody explain to him that I was right?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417524),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 418524),
          text: '“Perhaps.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 418524),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 419524),
          text: '“When?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 419524),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 421083),
          text: '“When he is ready to listen.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 421540),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 422323),
          text: 'Akhlaq sighed loudly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 423032),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 425831),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle closed the cupboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 425832),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 431311),
          text:
              '“You are discovering why truthfulness and patience often need each other.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 431712),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 436312),
          text: 'Imaan immediately remembered the card from the previous day.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 436312),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 438684),
          text: 'Truth may tell you where to stand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 438684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 441671),
          text: 'But what helps you remain standing there?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 443149),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 444140),
          text: '“Sabr,” she said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 444140),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446179),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446179),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 449739),
          text: 'Then he brought the Qur’an and sat with them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 449739),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 457179),
          text:
              '“Yesterday, we learned that Allah describes Idris, peace be upon him, as a Siddiq and a Prophet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 457179),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 461859),
          text:
              'Today, I want you to notice another place where Allah mentions him.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 461860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 472158),
          text:
              'He explained that in Surah Al-Anbiya, Allah mentions Isma‘il, Idris and Dhul-Kifl, and tells us that they were among those who were patient.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 472158),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 478747),
          text:
              'Allah then says that He admitted them into His mercy, and that they were among the righteous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 479411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 481668),
          text: 'Akhlaq listened carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 481668),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 484236),
          text: '“What was Idris patient about?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 484236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 486236),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle paused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 486236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 490235),
          text: '“The Qur’an does not give us a detailed list.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 490236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 491236),
          text: '“No story?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 491236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494781),
          text: '“Not one that I can confidently tell you from the Qur’an.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 495236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 498236),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked disappointed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 498236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 500235),
          text: '“But we know he was patient?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 500236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 501236),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 501236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 502204),
          text: '“How?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 502204),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 505204),
          text: '“Because Allah told us.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 505204),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 508204),
          text: 'That answer changed the atmosphere.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 508730),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 518203),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle continued, “Sometimes we become so interested in the event that we forget the character Allah wants us to notice.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 518804),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 521204),
          text: 'Imaan looked thoughtful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 522171),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 527052),
          text:
              '“So we shouldn’t invent a big incident just to make the story exciting.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 527052),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 528252),
          text: '“Exactly.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 529372),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 530332),
          text: 'Akhlaq smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 530332),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 532332),
          text: '“That is very honest.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 532837),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 534052),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 534052),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 535691),
          text: '“It should be.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 535691),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 538851),
          text: 'Then his expression became serious again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 538852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 541852),
          text: '“We may not know every test Idris faced.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 542140),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 555459),
          text:
              'But we know something more important: whatever Allah asked of him, whatever difficulties came with fulfilling his duty as a Prophet, Idris remained among the patient and righteous.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 556150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 557300),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 557831),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559320),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 561979),
          text: '“Sabr is often misunderstood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 562108),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 564937),
          text: 'People think patience means doing nothing.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 564937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 566587),
          text: '“Like sitting and waiting?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 567228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 569678),
          text: '“Sometimes waiting is part of it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 569678),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 572505),
          text: 'But sabr is much stronger than that.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 572505),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 574108),
          text: 'He held up one finger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 574908),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 579199),
          text:
              '“Sometimes sabr means controlling yourself when you are angry.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 579199),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 580252),
          text: 'Another finger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 580252),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 584996),
          text:
              '“Sometimes it means continuing a good action when you are tired.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 584996),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 585996),
          text: 'Another.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 585996),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 591036),
          text:
              '“Sometimes it means staying away from something wrong even when you badly want it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 591036),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 592036),
          text: 'Another.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 592036),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 597756),
          text:
              '“And sometimes it means remaining truthful even after telling the truth becomes uncomfortable.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 598366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 600196),
          text: 'Akhlaq understood immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 600196),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 601196),
          text: '“Hamza.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 601196),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 601929),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 602044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 606044),
          text:
              '“You did not need patience only yesterday when you reported what happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 606044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 611044),
          text:
              'You need it today when the consequences of doing the right thing are unpleasant.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 611399),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 615043),
          text: 'Imaan asked, “But what if someone keeps treating us badly?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 615044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 618044),
          text: 'Do we just stay patient forever?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 618044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 619044),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 619044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 621044),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle’s answer came quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 622012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 625011),
          text: '“Patience does not mean allowing injustice or harm.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 625012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 627012),
          text: 'Both children listened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 627012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 634011),
          text:
              '“If someone is bullying you, threatening you, hurting you or repeatedly mistreating you, you should speak to a responsible adult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 634538),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 638011),
          text: 'Sabr does not mean silence in the face of harm.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 638012),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 640011),
          text: '“Then what does it mean here?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 640595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 641012),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 641979),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 645300),
          text:
              '“It means you do not let Hamza’s anger change your character.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 646005),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 647300),
          text: 'Akhlaq became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 647300),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 650939),
          text: '“You do not insult him because he excluded you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 650940),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 654379),
          text: 'You do not spread his mistake around school.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 654380),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 657820),
          text: 'You do not remind everyone that he cheated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 657820),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 661948),
          text:
              'And you do not regret telling the truth merely because the right decision became uncomfortable.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 661948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 663078),
          text: 'That was harder.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 663078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 663948),
          text: 'Much harder.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 664430),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 665948),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked towards the window.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 665948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 668948),
          text: '“I wanted to tell everyone why he was angry.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 668948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 669536),
          text: '“I know.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 669536),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 670948),
          text: '“He deserved it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 671424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 672947),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 672948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 673424),
          text: '“Did he?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 674090),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 674948),
          text: 'Akhlaq hesitated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 674948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 676948),
          text: '“Maybe.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 676948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 685276),
          text: '“Or did you want him to feel some of what you were feeling?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 685851),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 687115),
          text: 'Akhlaq said nothing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 687115),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 688916),
          text: 'That question had found the truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 688916),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 692756),
          text: 'The next day, football began again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 693362),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 696396),
          text: 'Akhlaq did not ask Hamza to choose him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 696396),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 702581),
          text:
              'Instead, he joined some younger children on another part of the ground and helped them practise passing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 702581),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 706469),
          text: 'One of them could barely kick the ball straight.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 707167),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 708363),
          text: 'Akhlaq corrected him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 708363),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 709171),
          text: 'Again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 709171),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 709978),
          text: 'Again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 709978),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 710785),
          text: 'Again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 710785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 715788),
          text: '“Like this,” he said, moving the boy’s foot.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 715788),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 717564),
          text: 'The boy tried.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 717564),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 720232),
          text: 'The ball rolled sideways.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 721121),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 721852),
          text: 'Akhlaq sighed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 721852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 724047),
          text: 'Then stopped himself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 726242),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 726851),
          text: '“Again.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 726852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 730783),
          text: 'From the other side of the field, Hamza noticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 730783),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 732852),
          text: 'At first, he ignored them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 732852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 738404),
          text:
              'A few minutes later, the main football flew out of bounds and rolled towards Akhlaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 738852),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 740280),
          text: 'He picked it up.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 740280),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 744899),
          text:
              'For half a second, he considered kicking it in the opposite direction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 744900),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 747259),
          text: 'Instead, he threw it back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 747259),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 748739),
          text: 'Hamza caught it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 748739),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 750060),
          text: 'Their eyes met.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 750060),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 751660),
          text: 'Neither smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 751660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 754860),
          text: 'But Hamza quietly said, “Thanks.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 754860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 756739),
          text: 'It was not an apology.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 756739),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 758859),
          text: 'It was not friendship restored.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 758860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 760540),
          text: 'It was one word.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 760540),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 761779),
          text: 'But it was different from yesterday.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 762212),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 764588),
          text: 'Akhlaq returned to the younger children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 764991),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 766708),
          text: 'Imaan had seen everything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 766708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 769868),
          text: 'Later she whispered, “You didn’t force it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 769868),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 770628),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 770628),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 772348),
          text: '“Was it difficult?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 772348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 773188),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 773188),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 775588),
          text: '“Are you going to tell Sheikh Uncle?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 775588),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 776267),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 776267),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 777148),
          text: '“Why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 777625),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 778294),
          text: 'Akhlaq grinned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 778294),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 783756),
          text:
              '“Because then I would be impatiently checking whether my patience worked.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 784425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 785595),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 785595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 789595),
          text: 'That afternoon, Sheikh Uncle handed them another card.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 789595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 792508),
          text: 'On one side was yesterday’s word:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 792508),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 792956),
          text: 'SIDQ',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 792956),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 795616),
          text: 'Beside it was a new one:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 795616),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 796355),
          text: 'SABR',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 796355),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 799300),
          text: 'Underneath, Sheikh Uncle had written:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 799300),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 801675),
          text: 'Truth shows you the right path.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 801724),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 805804),
          text: 'Patience keeps you walking when the path becomes difficult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 806367),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 807963),
          text: 'Akhlaq turned the card over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 807964),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 810244),
          text: 'There was one final question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 810244),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 817764),
          text:
              'If Allah remembers Idris (A.S.) for truthfulness and patience, what kind of honour did Allah give him?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 817764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 820391),
          text: 'Under the question was a strange drawing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 820391),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 821163),
          text: 'A staircase.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 821691),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 824872),
          text: 'At the top of the staircase was a single star.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 825386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 826671),
          text: 'Imaan stared at it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 826671),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 828232),
          text: '“The high station.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 828232),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 830071),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 830072),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 832391),
          text: '“That is tomorrow’s story.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 832872),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 835032),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked carefully at the drawing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 835032),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 837351),
          text: '“Does ‘high’ mean heaven?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 837352),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 839336),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle closed the Qur’an.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 839832),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 845379),
          text:
              '“That answer will require us to look at two very important pieces of evidence.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 845380),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 846728),
          text: '“One from the Qur’an?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 847941),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 848615),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 848615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 849019),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 849019),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 850277),
          text: '“And the second?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 850277),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 852059),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 852060),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 856620),
          text:
              '“From one of the greatest journeys ever experienced by a human being.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 857453),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 859120),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s eyes widened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 859120),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 859466),
          text: '“The Mi‘raj?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 860158),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 861427),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle stood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 861628),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 865628),
          text: '“Now you are asking the right question.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 865628),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 870628),
          text:
              'And suddenly, waiting for Episode Three became very difficult again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 871348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 876627),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Stay Good When It Gets Difficult',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 876628),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 885595),
          text:
              'Choose one good action you already started, and continue it today even if it feels difficult, boring or unrewarded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 885595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 900595),
          text:
              'It may be completing your homework properly, practising a skill, helping someone who does not immediately appreciate it, staying calm when someone annoys you, or continuing an honest choice even after it creates inconvenience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 901564),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 908264),
          text:
