        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 424282),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 425282),
          text: '“Why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 425282),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 428282),
          text: '“Because people can be wrong about someone.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 428726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 434282),
          text:
              'Imaan added, “And popularity does not tell us what a person is like before Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 434875),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 436250),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 436250),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 438750),
          text: '“That is the important distinction.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 438750),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 445250),
          text:
              'He explained that children often learn very early to measure themselves through things people can see.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 445250),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 445892),
          text: 'Marks.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 445892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446664),
          text: 'Medals.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 447821),
          text: 'Positions.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 447821),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 448978),
          text: 'Followers.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 448978),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 449878),
          text: 'Clothes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 449878),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 450521),
          text: 'Money.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 450521),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 452450),
          text: 'Who gets selected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 452450),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 454218),
          text: 'Who gets praised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 454218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 456218),
          text: 'Who stands first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 456218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 459218),
          text: '“None of those things is automatically bad,” he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 459218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 462218),
          text: '“Working hard and succeeding is good.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 462218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 469218),
          text:
              'But the danger begins when we start believing that being above people is the same as being honoured by Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 469730),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 473218),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked down at the noticeboard far below.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 473218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 476736),
          text: '“I was upset because my name wasn’t there.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 476736),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 477290),
          text: '“I know.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 477290),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 477623),
          text: '“How?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 477623),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 480506),
          text: '“You have a very expressive face.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 480897),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 481583),
          text: 'Imaan laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 482170),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 483150),
          text: 'Akhlaq ignored her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 483150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 486186),
          text: '“So I shouldn’t care about recognition?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 486906),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 490272),
          text: '“You may appreciate recognition,” Sheikh Uncle replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 490272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 493306),
          text: '“But you should never make it the reason you do good.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 494154),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 496434),
          text: 'That sentence stayed with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 496434),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 498954),
          text: 'Then Imaan looked at the sky again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 498954),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 502114),
          text: '“But you said there were two pieces of evidence.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 502114),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 503906),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle closed the Qur’an.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 504354),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 505554),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 505554),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 510846),
          text:
              '“The second one takes us to an extraordinary night in the life of Prophet Muhammad ﷺ.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 512558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 513914),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s eyes widened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 513914),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 514214),
          text: '“The Mi‘raj.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 514705),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 516122),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 516122),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 525482),
          text:
              'He explained carefully that during the miraculous Night Journey and Ascension, Prophet Muhammad ﷺ was taken through the heavens.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 526042),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 531407),
          text: 'At different stages, he met Prophets whom Allah had honoured.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 532301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 533067),
          text: 'Adam (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 533067),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 534825),
          text: 'Yahya (A.S.) and Isa (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 535070),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 535683),
          text: 'Yusuf (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 535928),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 542824),
          text:
              'And when the Prophet ﷺ reached the fourth heaven, he met Idris (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 543732),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 545434),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked surprised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 545434),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 547930),
          text: '“So that is the high station!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 548650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 551453),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle raised one finger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 551453),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 552208),
          text: '“Careful.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 552855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 553610),
          text: 'Akhlaq stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 554631),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 558418),
          text: '“The Qur’an says Allah raised Idris to a high station.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 558418),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 566498),
          text:
              'The authentic narration of the Mi‘raj tells us that Prophet Muhammad ﷺ met Idris in the fourth heaven.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 566498),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 572458),
          text:
              'Scholars have discussed the connection, but we should not claim more than the texts clearly tell us.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 572954),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 573698),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 574026),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 576746),
          text: '“You just gave Akhlaq another honesty lesson.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 577546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 581386),
          text:
              '“This Prophet seems determined to keep doing that,” Akhlaq replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 581946),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 583546),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 583546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 585546),
          text: '“But think about what we can safely say.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 586266),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 594266),
          text:
              'Thousands of years after Idris (A.S.) lived, Prophet Muhammad ﷺ encountered him during one of the greatest journeys in human history.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 594682),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 597139),
          text: 'His life had ended long before.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 597139),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 599301),
          text: 'His possessions were gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 599301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 604714),
          text:
              'Whatever people of his time had said about him had disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 604714),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 608874),
          text: 'Yet Allah had preserved his name in revelation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 608874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 610009),
          text: 'Truthful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 610009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 611003),
          text: 'Prophet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 611003),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 611996),
          text: 'Patient.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 611996),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 613274),
          text: 'Righteous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 613962),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 616382),
          text: 'Raised to a high station.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 617171),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 619802),
          text: 'Akhlaq became unusually quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 620330),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 622842),
          text: 'Imaan looked at the empty sky.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 622842),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 626922),
          text: '“So real honour lasts longer than people’s praise.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 626922),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 628042),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 628042),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 631762),
          text: '“And sometimes people may not recognise it at all.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 631762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 632762),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 632762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 635318),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle looked at both children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 635318),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 638689),
          text: '“That is why chasing honour is so dangerous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 638689),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 646296),
          text:
              'The person who desperately wants to appear important may begin changing himself for people.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 646296),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 647775),
          text: 'He may exaggerate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 647775),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 648558),
          text: 'Show off.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 648558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 650112),
          text: 'Hide mistakes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 650112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 651796),
          text: 'Become jealous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 651796),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 653610),
          text: 'Push others down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 653898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 657898),
          text: 'Choose what looks impressive instead of what is right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 657898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 664198),
          text:
              '“But Idris (A.S.) teaches us a completely different direction,” Sheikh Uncle continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 664198),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 669598),
          text:
              '“Do not spend your life asking, ‘How high can I become in people’s eyes?’”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 669598),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 670798),
          text: 'He paused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 670798),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 674428),
          text: '“Ask, ‘What kind of person am I becoming before Allah?’”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 674802),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 680424),
          text:
              'As they walked downstairs, Akhlaq stopped beside the noticeboard again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 680424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 683203),
          text: 'Hamza’s name was still there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 683203),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 686074),
          text: 'He stared at it for a moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 686595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 687378),
          text: 'Imaan waited.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 687378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 689466),
          text: 'Then Akhlaq smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 690266),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 691890),
          text: '“He deserved that one.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 692272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 693706),
          text: 'Imaan looked surprised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 693834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 696676),
          text: '“Yesterday?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 696676),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 697307),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 697307),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 698886),
          text: '“Today?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 698886),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 699834),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 699834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 706609),
          text:
              'That evening, Akhlaq found one of the younger boys struggling to carry a large box of classroom materials.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 706609),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 709763),
          text: 'He helped him take it upstairs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 709763),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 710898),
          text: 'Nobody saw.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 710898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 713295),
          text: 'No teacher thanked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 713295),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 716942),
          text: 'His name did not appear anywhere.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 716942),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 720562),
          text: 'When he returned, Imaan was standing near the door.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 720562),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 722062),
          text: '“I saw that.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 722609),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 724582),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked disappointed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 724582),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 726442),
          text: '“You weren’t supposed to.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 726442),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 727442),
          text: '“Why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 727442),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 729402),
          text: '“I was testing something.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 729402),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 730402),
          text: '“What?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 730402),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 730403),
          text: 'He smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 730403),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 733770),
          text: '“Whether a good deed still feels good when nobody claps.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 733770),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 734155),
          text: '“And?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 734155),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 734156),
          text: 'Akhlaq thought for a moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 734156),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 735953),
          text: '“It feels quieter.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 735953),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 738522),
          text: 'He started walking away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 738522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 739806),
          text: 'Then turned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 739806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 743262),
          text: '“But maybe quieter is sometimes better.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 743262),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 749359),
          text:
              'Before they left, Sheikh Uncle handed them the final card of the Idris (A.S.) series.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 749359),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 751809),
          text: 'On it were three words:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 751809),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 752773),
          text: 'SIDQ',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 752773),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 753738),
          text: 'SABR',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 753738),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 754339),
          text: 'HONOUR',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 754339),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 756344),
          text: 'Underneath was written:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 756344),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 759051),
          text: 'Truthfulness tells you who to be.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 759051),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 762291),
          text: 'Patience helps you remain that person.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 762291),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 765354),
          text: 'True honour belongs to Allah to give.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 765776),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 767571),
          text: 'Imaan turned the card over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 767571),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 770474),
          text: 'There was no staircase this time.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 770474),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 773498),
          text: 'There was a drawing of dark waves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 773706),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 777786),
          text: 'In the middle of them was the outline of something enormous.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 779197),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 780506),
          text: 'Akhlaq narrowed his eyes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 781386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 782506),
          text: '“Is that a boat?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 783766),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 784906),
          text: 'Imaan looked closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 785706),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 789706),
          text: 'Underneath, Sheikh Uncle had written only one question:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 790426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 795674),
          text:
              'How long could you keep telling the truth if almost nobody listened?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 796607),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 797674),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked up.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 797674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 800674),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle was already walking away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 800674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 801674),
          text: '“Wait!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 801674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 803674),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle turned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 803674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 804674),
          text: '“Who is next?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 804674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 805674),
          text: 'He smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 805674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 813674),
          text:
              '“A Prophet whose patience would be measured not in days or months... but across generations.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 814045),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 816162),
          text: 'Imaan looked again at the waves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 816578),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 818522),
          text: '“Nuh, peace be upon him.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 819134),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 820482),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 820482),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 827562),
          text:
              '“And his story will teach you that sometimes the hardest part of patience is not waiting for something to happen.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 827562),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 828882),
          text: 'He paused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 828882),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 833602),
          text:
              '“It is continuing your mission when nothing seems to be changing.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 833610),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 836030),
          text: 'The wind moved across the courtyard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 836647),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 840350),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at the picture of the enormous vessel again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 840350),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 845590),
          text: 'For the first time, the word 950 had not even been mentioned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 845590),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 852230),
          text:
              'Yet somehow, he already felt that the next story was going to be much longer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 852230),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 856578),
